From: PowOS <noreply@powback.com>
Subject: [PATCH] kicker: the dashboard doesn't focus its search field while closing

reset() runs when the dashboard closes as well as when it opens, and it focused the search field both times. After a
category had taken the focus, that was a change of focus on a closing window, to a text field: on the phone, KWin
raised Android's keyboard as the menu went away. It focuses the field only while shown now.
---
--- a/applets/kicker/DashboardRepresentation.qml
+++ b/applets/kicker/DashboardRepresentation.qml
@@ -109,7 +109,11 @@
 
     function reset() {
         searchField.clear();
-        searchField.forceActiveFocus(Qt.OtherFocusReason)
+        // PowOS: only while shown. Closing runs this too, and focusing the field then - after a category had taken
+        // the focus, so it was a change - gave a closing window a text field's focus: the phone's keyboard came up.
+        if (root.visible) {
+            searchField.forceActiveFocus(Qt.OtherFocusReason)
+        }
         globalFavoritesGrid.currentIndex = -1;
         systemFavoritesGrid.currentIndex = -1;
         filterList.currentIndex = 0;
